      "response_excerpt": {
        "success": true,
        "message": null,
        "summary": "## Revenue Recognition Analysis by Product Category\n\n**Policy Applied:** Per the revenue recognition policy, only orders with `order_status = 'PAID'` are recognized as revenue. All `REFUNDED` orders (1,220 orders totaling ¥985,757.50 across all categories) have been excluded from recognized revenue.\n\n### Recognized Revenue by Category (Ranked):\n\n| Rank | Category | Recognized Revenue | Paid Orders | Units Sold |\n|------|----------|-------------------|-------------|------------|\n| 1 | **手机** (Phones) | ¥698,031.25 | 670 | 2,010 |\n| 2 | **美妆** (Cosmetics) | ¥633,245.25 | 660 | 1,980 |\n| 3 | **家电** (Appliances) | ¥612,073.50 | 670 | 2,010 |\n| 4 | **食品** (Food) | ¥443,939.75 | 640 | 1,280 |\n| 5 | **服饰** (Clothing) | ¥415,348.00 | 630 | 1,260 |\n| 6 | **电脑** (Computers) | ¥400,120.75 | 640 | 1,280 |\n\n**Key Findings:**\n- The **手机 (Phones)** category leads with the highest recognized revenue of ¥698,031.25, closely followed by **美妆 (Cosmetics)** at ¥633,245.25.\n- **电脑 (Computers)** ranks lowest in recognized revenue at ¥400,120.75.\n- Refunded orders were excluded in full compliance with the revenue recognition policy. The category with the most refunded value was **美妆** (¥208,401.75 refunded), while **电脑** had the least refunded amount (¥122,950.25).",
